    - rid: 4927988405324218376
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Which, if I can be honest with <b>you</b>...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That song was the only <i>real</i> thing I had back home.)
